{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01094",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.25,
      "end_seconds": 4.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.08,
      "end_seconds": 11.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.37,
      "end_seconds": 16.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "So, I've been sweating, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.27,
      "end_seconds": 20.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.99,
      "end_seconds": 32.73,
      "duration_seconds": 11.74,
      "text": "Honestly I can't say exactly when it started. It might have been last month or the month before, I really can't pin it down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.56,
      "end_seconds": 38.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.8,
      "end_seconds": 53.33,
      "duration_seconds": 13.53,
      "text": "It's a few times a day. I'd call it severe. I've also been feeling sick. As for feeling sick, I'd give it a four, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.07,
      "end_seconds": 59.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.23,
      "end_seconds": 69.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.15,
      "end_seconds": 89.34,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 107, SpO2 97 percent on room air. And pressure 117 over 75, temperature is 37.1 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.6,
      "end_seconds": 96.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.62,
      "end_seconds": 102.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.28,
      "end_seconds": 107.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.51,
      "end_seconds": 110.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.64,
      "end_seconds": 113.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.74,
      "end_seconds": 133.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "You are pale and sweaty, and your pulse is fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.65,
      "end_seconds": 143.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Alright, have you had any cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.38,
      "end_seconds": 149.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "No, none, no cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.0,
      "end_seconds": 153.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Any fever or leg swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.52,
      "end_seconds": 158.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "No, uh, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.01,
      "end_seconds": 162.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.54,
      "end_seconds": 166.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.98,
      "end_seconds": 169.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.05,
      "end_seconds": 174.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.68,
      "end_seconds": 188.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.42,
      "end_seconds": 193.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Just part of my thyroid removed, years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.28,
      "end_seconds": 197.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.0,
      "end_seconds": 204.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "Metoprolol. I take it 50 milligrams, twice a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.62,
      "end_seconds": 211.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.81,
      "end_seconds": 222.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.82,
      "text": "I swim twice a week. I look after my grandchildren most days. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.64,
      "end_seconds": 238.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.95,
      "end_seconds": 245.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure for about ten years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.87,
      "end_seconds": 260.41,
      "duration_seconds": 13.54,
      "text": "Okay, I can see high blood pressure in your file as well. Putting it all together, it fits best with a possible heart attack. Unstable angina is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.58,
      "end_seconds": 287.96,
      "duration_seconds": 9.38,
      "text": "I think a troponin blood test makes sense here, for chest pain. I want an ECG done, that's for chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.82,
      "end_seconds": 290.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Right, understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.73,
      "end_seconds": 306.88,
      "duration_seconds": 14.15,
      "text": "What I'm giving you is aspirin, 300 milligrams, once now, single dose. That's for possible heart attack. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.96,
      "end_seconds": 314.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Uh, can I collect it from my own pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.26,
      "end_seconds": 329.93,
      "duration_seconds": 14.67,
      "text": "Stay lying down and do not eat or drink. Do get help quickly if the pain returns. See me again straight away. Let me check I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.19,
      "end_seconds": 345.07,
      "duration_seconds": 10.88,
      "text": "So, uh, I take the aspirin, 300 milligrams, once now and come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.18,
      "end_seconds": 351.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. So, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.34,
      "end_seconds": 354.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}